<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - March 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - March 6.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chaired a cabinet meeting on the audio-visual sector.</p>
<p>- Qatar Crown Prince Sheikh Jassim bin Hamad is expected to visit Tunisia on March 8-10.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- A cabinet meeting discussed a draft to split the radio and television broadcasting corporation.</p>
<p>LE RENOUVEAU</p>
<p>- Tunisian and French officials held talks on boosting cooperation on sea transport.</p>
